1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,683
AI is everywhere in software engineering.

2
00:00:02,683 --> 00:00:07,155
But faster output is not the same as more value.

3
00:00:07,155 --> 00:00:14,758
Google Cloud's DORA research found that over seventy-five percent of respondents already used AI in daily work.

4
00:00:14,758 --> 00:00:22,361
Yet a twenty-five percent rise in adoption was associated with lower delivery throughput—and seven-point-two percent lower stability.

5
00:00:22,361 --> 00:00:25,938
Local speed did not automatically become system-level value.

6
00:00:26,388 --> 00:00:29,929
That is the gap GroundTruth is built to close.

7
00:00:29,929 --> 00:00:37,010
It is an institutional learning control plane for AI-native engineering: not another code generator, and not another dashboard.

8
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:42,911
Its job is to make value, quality, judgment, and organizational capability compound with AI velocity.

9
00:00:43,361 --> 00:00:56,250
The loop is simple: observe a failure, reconstruct its cause, search the entire organization for the same mechanism, prove the exposure, preserve the learning, and act on the next change before customers pay for the same mistake again.

10
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,734
Here is the flagship proof.

11
00:00:58,734 --> 00:01:01,988
Kubernetes issue twenty-nine-two-nine-seven reported intermittent ConfigMap mount failures.

12
00:01:01,988 --> 00:01:06,869
GroundTruth receives the real issue and source from a pinned pre-fix commit.

13
00:01:06,869 --> 00:01:12,157
The eventual fixing pull request, maintainer explanation, and four-file patch scope are sealed.

14
00:01:12,157 --> 00:01:14,597
The agents cannot see the answer.

15
00:01:15,047 --> 00:01:17,922
Five Gemini agents run through Google ADK.

16
00:01:17,922 --> 00:01:20,796
The Evidence Investigator separates observations from hypotheses.

17
00:01:20,796 --> 00:01:25,724
The Causal Analyst identifies a shallow copy with a shared nested pointer.

18
00:01:25,724 --> 00:01:29,009
The Pattern Scout searches beyond the reported component.

19
00:01:29,009 --> 00:01:31,473
The Adversary designs a falsifying interleaving.

20
00:01:31,473 --> 00:01:37,633
And the Learning Architect turns verified evidence into code controls, process changes, and human development.

21
00:01:37,633 --> 00:01:40,097
Each handoff is structured and attributable.

22
00:01:40,547 --> 00:01:45,165
But an agent does not get to declare itself correct.

23
00:01:45,165 --> 00:01:48,397
Deterministic evaluators require the complete causal signature.

24
00:01:48,397 --> 00:01:53,939
Then a controlled interleaving proves the failure: mount A writes its name;

25
00:01:53,939 --> 00:01:57,171
mount B overwrites the same nested object;

26
00:01:57,171 --> 00:01:59,480
mount A reads B's name.

27
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,327
A fresh-object control passes.

28
00:02:01,327 --> 00:02:02,251
Models propose.

29
00:02:02,251 --> 00:02:03,174
Evidence decides.

30
00:02:03,624 --> 00:02:11,283
Starting from one ConfigMap incident, GroundTruth identifies three proactive sibling exposures: Secret, Downward API, and GitRepo.

31
00:02:11,283 --> 00:02:15,112
Only now is Kubernetes pull request twenty-nine-six-four-one unsealed.

32
00:02:15,112 --> 00:02:26,121
The four independently discovered paths are exactly the four paths later changed by the maintainers: one hundred percent precision, one hundred percent recall.

33
00:02:26,571 --> 00:02:34,680
This verified lesson becomes an append-only, SHA-two-fifty-six hash chain: hypothesis recorded, evidence verified, ground truth confirmed, control attached.

34
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:40,986
The control then blocks a synthetic future Northstar change carrying the same causal pattern.

35
00:02:40,986 --> 00:02:43,689
The future example is clearly labeled;

36
00:02:43,689 --> 00:02:47,744
the Kubernetes evidence and production agent run are real.

37
00:02:48,194 --> 00:02:51,149
GroundTruth does not rank engineers or infer incompetence.

38
00:02:51,149 --> 00:02:57,428
It turns the case into a teach-back on pointer ownership, shared review guidance, and team-level knowledge coverage.

39
00:02:57,428 --> 00:02:59,644
The goal is not more activity.

40
00:02:59,644 --> 00:03:03,707
It is better systems, stronger judgment, resilient products, and verified value.

41
00:03:04,157 --> 00:03:06,746
This is running on Google Cloud.

42
00:03:06,746 --> 00:03:10,197
Gemini three-point-five Flash powers five structured ADK agents.

43
00:03:10,197 --> 00:03:18,824
The FastAPI workflow runs in a Google Cloud Function, Firestore preserves assurance runs, and trusted evaluators own the verification boundary.

44
00:03:18,824 --> 00:03:24,432
The console shows the active production function, version four, and real invocation metrics.

45
00:03:24,432 --> 00:03:32,197
The full public run is persisted as assure E F seven E four zero four five eight six.

46
00:03:32,647 --> 00:03:34,633
AI will keep changing.

47
00:03:34,633 --> 00:03:46,051
The principle will not: excellent organizations turn experience into shared capability, protect future value, and help their people build better systems next time.

48
00:03:46,051 --> 00:03:46,548
GroundTruth.

49
00:03:46,548 --> 00:03:48,037
One team learns.

50
00:03:48,037 --> 00:03:51,513
The whole organization gets stronger—and value compounds.
